---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import GitHubGraph from '@/components/GitHubGraph.vue'
import Sponsor from '@/components/Sponsor.astro'
import siteConfig from '@/site-config'
import icedteaIcon from '@/assets/CTF/ICEDTEA.jpg'
import tryhackmeIcon from '@/assets/tryhackme.svg'
import heapunderflowIcon from '@/assets/heapunderflow.webp'
import nhncIcon from '@/assets/nhnc-logo.webp'
import thjccIcon from '@/assets/thjcc-logo.png'
import ummitosIcon from '@/assets/ummitos-logo.png'
import cryptohackIcon from '@/assets/cryptohack-logo.png'
import oscpCert from '@/assets/certs/oscp.webp'
import cwesCert from '@/assets/certs/cwes.png'
import cjcaCert from '@/assets/certs/cjca.png'
import pt1Cert from '@/assets/certs/thm-pt1.png'
import { fetchGitHubContributions } from '@/utils/github-contributions'

const ogImage = { src: '/og/index.png', alt: 'UmmIt Kin Personal Website' }

const contributions = await fetchGitHubContributions(siteConfig.github)
---

<BaseLayout description={siteConfig.description} image={ogImage}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1 class="text-title flex items-center gap-2">
      Kin =]
      <i class="i-simple-icons-linux text-3xl"></i>
    </h1>
    <p>HKer, InfoSec enthusiast, passionate about GNU/Linux, Web security, and open source.</p>

    <p>
      CTF Team
      <a href="https://ic3dt3a.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="magic-link">
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={icedteaIcon} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span>ICEDTEA
      </a>
      <a href="https://ctftime.org/team/405936/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="magic-link">
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={heapunderflowIcon} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span
        >HeapUnderFlow
      </a>
      <br />
      Challenge Creator
      <a href="https://ctftime.org/event/2818/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="magic-link">
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={nhncIcon} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span>NHNC CTF
      </a>
      <a href="https://thjcc.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="magic-link">
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={thjccIcon} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span>THJCC CTF
      </a>
      <br />
      Hacking
      <a href="https://tryhackme.com/p/UmmIt" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="magic-link">
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><i class="i-simple-icons-tryhackme text-[#C11111]"></i></span>TryHackMe
      </a>
      <a href="https://app.hackthebox.com/users/2099997" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="magic-link">
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><i class="i-simple-icons-hackthebox text-[#9FEF00]"></i></span>HackTheBox
      </a>
      <a href="https://cryptohack.org/user/UmmIt/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="magic-link">
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={cryptohackIcon} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span>CryptoHack
      </a>
      <br />
      Creator
      <a href="https://docs.ummit.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="magic-link">
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={ummitosIcon} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span>UmmItOS
      </a>
      <br />
      Candidate
      <a href="https://www.offsec.com/courses/pen-200/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="magic-link">
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={oscpCert} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span>OSCP
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://academy.hackthebox.com/preview/certifications/htb-certified-web-exploitation-specialist"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="magic-link"
      >
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={cwesCert} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span>CWES
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://academy.hackthebox.com/preview/certifications/htb-certified-junior-cybersecurity-associate"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="magic-link"
      >
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={cjcaCert} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span>CJCA
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://tryhackme.com/certification/junior-penetration-tester"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="magic-link"
      >
        <span class="magic-link-icon"><Image src={pt1Cert} alt="" width={500} height={500} /></span>PT1
      </a>
    </p>

    <p>
      I’ve been self-taught computer stuff since I was a kid, and I’m currently studying InfoSec in Hong Kong. My
      interests are wide-ranging — red teaming, reverse engineering, web development, web hacking, and app development.
      As you see, mostly are related to software hacking stuff. I started seriously learning around middle school,
      beginning with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, then moving on to C#, VB.NET, and more. Those are mostly behind me now.
      I’m focused on web hacking and redteam work now.
    </p>
    <p>
      Also, I'm a huge GNU/Linux enthusiast. I've used at least 20 different GNU/Linux distros and experiments. I
      currently use Arch Linux as my main system and have been using it for seven years. Yes, I'm still a student, but I
      already have over seven years of experience. I actually started back in secondary school. Right now I'm using my
      own Arch-based distribution called <a href="https://docs.ummit.dev" class="prose-link" target="_black">UmmItOS</a> named
      after my internet nickname. XD
    </p>
    <p>
      I used to be a Windows user, but I’m now 100% on GNU/Linux and only touch Windows when I’m attacking Active
      Directory. There are lots of stories from my journey ... this is just a small part :D
    </p>
    <p>When I’m not coding or hacking, I’m usually watching anime. Pretty boring ... Yes. I know what you think :(</p>

    <hr class="hr-line" />

    <p class="flex gap-x-4 gap-y-2 flex-wrap">
      {
        siteConfig.socialLinks.map((link) => (
          <a aria-label={link.text} href={link.href} target="_blank" class="prose-link">
            <i class:list={[link.icon]} />
            {link.text}
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2 sm:gap-6 mt-4 text-sm opacity-80">
      <a class="prose-link flex items-center gap-1" href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>
        <i class="i-ri-mail-line"></i>
        {siteConfig.email}
        <span class="opacity-70">(casual)</span>
      </a>
      <a class="prose-link flex items-center gap-1" href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email_two}`}>
        <i class="i-ri-briefcase-line"></i>
        {siteConfig.email_two}
        <span class="opacity-70">(job)</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <hr class="hr-line" />

    {
      contributions && (
        <>
          <section class="mt-8">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-medium mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 opacity-80">
              <i class="i-ri-github-line" />
              Contributions
            </h2>
            <GitHubGraph client:visible days={contributions.days} total={contributions.total} />
          </section>

          <hr class="hr-line" />
        </>
      )
    }

    <section class="mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-6">Timeline</h2>
      <div class="relative border-l-2 border-neutral-700 pl-6 space-y-8">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-8 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <i class="i-ri-flag-line text-black text-xs"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-medium">
            ICEDTEA CTF
            <a
              href="https://ic3dt3a.org/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Visit ICEDTEA CTF website"
              class="timeline-link"
            >
              <i class="i-ri-external-link-line text-sm"></i>
            </a>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-70">2023 - Present</p>
          <p class="text-sm mt-2 opacity-80">Team member</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-8 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <i class="i-ri-flag-line text-black text-xs"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-medium">
            HeapUnderFlow CTF
            <a
              href="https://ctftime.org/team/405936/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Visit HeapUnderFlow CTF website"
              class="timeline-link"
            >
              <i class="i-ri-external-link-line text-sm"></i>
            </a>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-70">2025 - Present</p>
          <p class="text-sm mt-2 opacity-80">Core member</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-8 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <i class="i-ri-edit-line text-black text-xs"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-medium">
            No Hack No CTF
            <a
              href="https://ctftime.org/event/2818/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Visit No Hack No CTF on CTFtime"
              class="timeline-link"
            >
              <i class="i-ri-external-link-line text-sm"></i>
            </a>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-70">Challenge Creator & Web Designer</p>
          <p class="text-sm mt-2 opacity-80">gitgit & Crackme challenges creator, website designer.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-8 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <i class="i-ri-terminal-box-line text-black text-xs"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-medium">
            TryHackMe
            <a
              href="https://tryhackme.com/p/UmmIt"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Visit TryHackMe profile"
              class="timeline-link"
            >
              <i class="i-ri-external-link-line text-sm"></i>
            </a>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-70">Active Player</p>
          <p class="text-sm mt-2 opacity-80">Ranked in the top 4% of TryHackMe players</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -left-8 top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <i class="i-ri-bug-line text-black text-xs"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-medium">Zero-Day Hunting</h3>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-70">Randomly hunting zero-day vulnerabilities</p>
          <p class="text-sm mt-2 opacity-80">I do it for fun and learning purposes, no public disclosures yet.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="hr-line" />

    <section class="mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-medium mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 opacity-80">
        <i class="i-ri-flashlight-line"></i>
        Stacks
      </h2>

      <div class="stack-desc bg-neutral-800 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-1">
        <span class="font-semibold text-base text-main flex items-center gap-2">
          The Stacks for my development, hacking, and daily use.
        </span>
        <small class="text-xs text-main/60 italic mt-1"> Cannot list all here, just the main ones :) </small>
      </div>

      <div class="marquee-container">
        <div class="marquee-track animate-marquee">
          <div class="marquee-content">
            <i class="i-simple-icons-javascript text-4xl opacity-60" title="JavaScript"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-typescript text-4xl opacity-60" title="TypeScript"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-python text-4xl opacity-60" title="Python"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-gnubash text-4xl opacity-60" title="Bash"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-linux text-4xl opacity-60" title="Linux"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-archlinux text-4xl opacity-60" title="Arch Linux"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-nixos text-4xl opacity-60" title="NixOS"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-debian text-4xl opacity-60" title="Debian"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-raspberrypi text-4xl opacity-60" title="Raspberry Pi"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-neovim text-4xl opacity-60" title="Neovim"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-git text-4xl opacity-60" title="Git"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="marquee-content" aria-hidden="true">
            <i class="i-simple-icons-javascript text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-typescript text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-python text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-gnubash text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-linux text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-archlinux text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-nixos text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-debian text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-raspberrypi text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-neovim text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-git text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="marquee-container mt-4">
        <div class="marquee-track animate-marquee-reverse">
          <div class="marquee-content">
            <i class="i-simple-icons-docker text-4xl opacity-60" title="Docker"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-nginx text-4xl opacity-60" title="Nginx"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-cloudflare text-4xl opacity-60" title="Cloudflare"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-wireguard text-4xl opacity-60" title="WireGuard"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-burpsuite text-4xl opacity-60" title="Burp Suite"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-wireshark text-4xl opacity-60" title="Wireshark"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-kalilinux text-4xl opacity-60" title="Kali Linux"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-metasploit text-4xl opacity-60" title="Metasploit"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-html5 text-4xl opacity-60" title="HTML5"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-css3 text-4xl opacity-60" title="CSS3"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="marquee-content" aria-hidden="true">
            <i class="i-simple-icons-docker text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-nginx text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-cloudflare text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-wireguard text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-burpsuite text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-wireshark text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-kalilinux text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-metasploit text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-html5 text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
            <i class="i-simple-icons-css3 text-4xl opacity-60"></i>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .marquee-container {
    overflow: hidden;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, black 10%, black 90%, transparent 100%);
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, black 10%, black 90%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .marquee-track {
    display: flex;
    width: max-content;
  }

  .marquee-content {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-right: 3rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .animate-marquee {
    animation: marquee 40s linear infinite;
  }

  .animate-marquee-reverse {
    animation: marquee-reverse 40s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes marquee {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
  }

  @keyframes marquee-reverse {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
  }

  .marquee-container:hover .marquee-track {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }

  .magic-link-icon :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 0.125rem;
  }

  .magic-link-icon i {
    font-size: 1em;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .magic-link.no-hover {
    cursor: default;
  }

  .magic-link.no-hover:hover {
    background: rgba(136, 136, 136, 0.15);
  }

  .timeline-link {
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    border: none !important;
  }

  .timeline-link:hover {
    opacity: 1;
    border: none !important;
  }
</style>
